WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:06.600
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.780
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.380
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.920
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don 't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.930
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.330
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.890
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.500
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.200
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.980
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
onek inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.350
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.610
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:59.760
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.900
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.830
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.640
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.870
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:16.170
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:22.710
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.270
<i>A vacation?! You can'! be serious!</i>

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:55.110
This is a request from
agent Jim Skylark as well.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.310
He suggested that you all
be given the chance...

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.980
...to enjoy summer vacation
like normal high school students.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.190
In other words, he wants
us out of the picture.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.150
Commander...

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:10.460
This is an order.
Take this opportunity to relax for a while.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.170
Hi!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.210
Big brother...

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.210
Mom!

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.250
What is it?
Big brother!

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.240
Big brother, you gave
it your best shot.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.820
I knew that honor student
stuff was too good to be true!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:41.990
I'm home.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:43.960
Welcome home, Shun.
- Don't worry, don't worry!

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:51.830
I'll have another one, Fei!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.870
Go ahead, go ahead, go ahead...

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:59.970
Oh, my! So that's how you're
supposed to eat watermelon.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.880
Psst, Kaoru bought a new swimsuit.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.320
My, that's wonderful!

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:11.320
But what does that have
to do with watermelon?

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.820
She wanted to get the Captain to take
her to the pool, but he went home.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.720
Oh! You're eating to
drown your sorrow!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:26.240
Still, if that's the case, why don't
you pay the Captain a visit at his home?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:33.180
Then we can all go swimming
in the pool at his house.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.880
Um, no, I couldn't possibly...

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.610
...do something so daring!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.560
Did you enjoy the food, Ruriko?

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:47.850
Yeah.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:51.860
It's been a long time
since we all ate together.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.890
She can't help it.
Ruriko is a busy girl.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.200
I'm sorry.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.300
It's all right, but try
not to work too hard.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.440
Oh!

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.380
Um, excuse me for
a second. Kuroganefl

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.780
Kurogane!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.820
Please don't stop me.
The ramen will get soggy.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.420
You're planning to make me
a laughing stock again, aren't you?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:26.260
But I never laughed at you...

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.130
I admire you for
helping out at home.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.260
I mean it.

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.270
Thanks to you...

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:40.400
Thanks to your mess-up,
I was forced...

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.680
...to go on vacation, too.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.650
If l only had Earth Defense
work to do, I wouldn't have to...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.450
...to dress up like this and help out.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:05:00.430
I'm sure you're aware of how hard
everyone has worked, Commander...

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.930
So why...?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.200
Ms. Ochiai.
Yes, sir!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.300
Please take care of this
by the end of the clay.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.000
Yes... sir.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.490
Commander, is this...?!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.180
Excuse me!

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.520
Argh! Everybody else
gets summer vacation...

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.490
...so why am I the
only one stuck working?!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.660
Why?! But I'm actually too
serious about my job to complain...

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.170
Bancho!

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.330
Huhn?! What do you want, huh?!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.400
These, these! They're orders
I received just now!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.440
Orders?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.340
What is this?!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.210
Megane...

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.210
I take it you're interested?

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:56.480
W- w- Why?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:00.520
Why doesn't it mention my vacation?!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.620
It contains something more
important than your vacation, silly!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.150
Is anything more important
than vacations?

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.830
Humans... are foolish organisms.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:18.000
The victories they receive will make
their minds come apart at the seams.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:21.470
My strategic retreat
in the previous battle...

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:24.480
...was also completely within
the boundaries of our calculation.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.520
They place too much faith
in their new weaponry...

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.390
...and their strength
has also been divided.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:35.430
Now is the time for a
great offensive attack.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.430
I'm going to enjoy this.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:44.340
I'm going to enjoy watching those
human maggots writhe in agony...

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.030
...until their tragically wretched deaths.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.970
That remark lacks
strategic calculation.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.110
Our real objective is
not their annihilation.

00:06:56.380 --> 00:07:00.580
Don't be stupid. We
should crush those humans!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.090
They are born in filth,
and multipy endlessly!

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:05.120
They are exactly like maggots.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.030
So you hate humans in spite
of being a human yourself?

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:39.080
HEIL, VADER!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:43.960
Did you witness my greatest
formation of fusion!?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.340
You don't get it, do you?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:05.350
I hate humans <i>because</i> I am human.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.290
So, I end up coming here.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.290
Oh, intense!

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.370
What's that?!

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.210
Has the enemy shown up again?!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.480
Jun! Misao! After you land
the choppers in a safe zone...

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.520
...launch in the gate robots immediately!

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:43.350
We'll finish this in one blow
like the last time! Understood?!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.050
<i>Roger!</i>

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.730
Just wait. I'll sink you in
Tokyo Bay along with your old relics.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.860
I'll leave you behind!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:57.230
Oh, be quiet! It's hard
for girls to get ready!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.170
What do you mean,
"girls"? Sheesh.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.580
I bet you're glad to be going to the
Bon festival with such a pretty girl!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.310
Idiot.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.950
Well, shall we go?

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:18.960
Oh! I have to show Dad my yukata!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.960
Don't bother. Let's go!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.560
What?!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.100
Hit him again,jun!!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.640
Right!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.510
LIGHTNING!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.760
It's no good!
It's the same story here...

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.630
Give up. My magic is infinite.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.790
They will regenerate as
quickly as you destroy them.

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.600
Over here!

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:10.000
Jim?!

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:15.870
You called? Now let's
do it full throttle!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.490
What?!
Maintain your composure.

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.970
It takes more than speed
several times that of sound...

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:46.980
...to escape my brain-
precise marksmanship!

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.910
Die, human.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.060
Arrow of Light!!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.390
Stop it!! Even gate robots
can't stand up to him!!

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.440
Yeah, but if I don't do something...!

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.340
<i>Ooh, don't blame me.</i>

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.540
<i>Go and apologize, Ruri.</i>

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:25.440
<i>But I, uh...</i>

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.960
<i>It's Miracle Mask to the rescuel!</i>

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.020
<i>That's horrible!</i>

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.070
<i>Teacher, Ukiya broke the vase!</i>

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.960
<i>Adios, people of Earth!
Miracle Dash!</i>

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:47.400
<i>Hey! Ukiya!! Are you
playmg pranks again?!</i>

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.770
<i>I needed to act, or else
I would return to my old self.</i>

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:56.640
...so all this time, I tried
so hard to change myself!

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:02.250
<i>Here comes').!</i>

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.490
Change of target!

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:36.390
Come on, hurry, hurry!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.390
You're acting like a child!

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.190
<i>I am</i> a child! Right, Mom?

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:45.090
Yes... To me, you're both children.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.460
Darn it, I'm in high
school now, you know.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.940
You...?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.840
She is waiting.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.780
She is crying.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.710
A small girl is crying.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.480
<i>Rurippe!!</i>

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.490
Wh- What is this?

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.820
<i>You're... all right?!</i>

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.370
Jim?

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:23.400
<i>Thats why I told you...</i>

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.240
<i>I told you kids... to stay out of it.</i>

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:27.830
<i>Jim</i>

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.470
<i>Jim! What? wrong
wfth you, Jim? Jim?</i>

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.510
Jim? Jim?!?

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.010
Rurippe...

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.980
Cmon, let's go!

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:43.450
I'm sorry, Saemi! Mom!

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.290
Hey, where are you
going, big brother?!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.690
It's okay. He'll be back soon.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.130
While we're waiting, let's go
and have some cotton candy.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.830
No way.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.390
That stuff is for kids.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:01.370
Ukiya!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.500
Megane! It's you, Megane!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:07.840
Please hurry. This time, robot
battleships appeared on dream island!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.070
Yeah, I know!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:11.780
- What?!
- At any rate, get in!

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.510
No, I'll go in the Yotahachi.
It'll be faster!

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:17.990
You can't! We got the commander's
permission for this and everything!

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.460
Permission?!

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.250
For this!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.930
Light of Miracles!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:46.510
The Gate of Life, huh?
That's a touching sight...

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.220
Heil, Vader!!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:58.850
You and your ugly mechanized dolls
shall become new garbage on this island!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.600
I have to fight... lf l don't...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.240
...l'll always be Runny-nosed Rurippe...!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.950
Don't cry.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.910
Yukino?

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:22.720
He's coming, so please stop crying.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.610
<i>Let's go, Ukiya!!</i>

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.450
<i>Go?! Megane, there's nothing
but ocean in front of us!</i>

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.990
<i>I can'! swim very well!
Whatever shall I do, dammit?!</i>

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.990
Let's do it, Megane!
Do what?!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.850
HERE GOES!

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.200
It's Miracle Mask to the rescue...

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.910
OPEN THE GATE!!!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.940
W- What?!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.320
The fools! Did they
bring out the Zero?!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.690
Stop! You can't handle it!!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.200
W' Why you!!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.560
I remember. I remember you...

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.190
...human with the name Shun Ukiya.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.940
I haven't yet repaid you for
foiling my bullet train robot.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.300
What?!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:17:00.080
This thing is completely berserk!
I can't make it drive straightl!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:04.320
Absurd! My mechanized brain
can't possibly miss the target...

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:06.190
All cannons fire!!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.390
Incredible...

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:17.160
Even my Gate of Perception is
incapable of predicting his moves!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.000
Yeah, but he's just runningl!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:24.030
I realize that! VACUOUS...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.670
...MISSl LE!!

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:37.280
Damn! I can't aim properly like this!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.420
You're an eyesore.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:51.630
At this range, it's impossible to
dodge my artillery! Die, human!!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.040
No, it isn't over yet!!

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:09.110
Don't tell me he's going to
test the limits of the engine?!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.780
The Zero's output is too irregular.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.760
If it's put to the limit, it will be
impossible to control that machine!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.160
That's suicidal...

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.620
Even a machine this erratic
can't miss at this range!!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.140
Let's rumble, Kikai Shogun!!

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:33.970
TAKE THIS!!

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:46.480
T-This Can't be!! HEIL, VADER!!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.260
How could my magic have been
thwarted by something so simple?!

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.230
HolyCow!!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:03.470
Megane, what happened to Ukiya
and those English guys?! Well?!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.140
I'm gonna fall! I'm gonna fall!!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:36.140
It looks like they failed to
factor a certain major idiot...

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.370
...from the Far Eastern branch
into their calculations.

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.640
Miracles come to only
those who believe...

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.010
Ukiya...

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.240
Aren't you going to dance?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.500
Forget it. Humph.
Big brother, you liar...

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.380
Who are you calling a liar?

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.840
Big brother...

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:21.680
Since we're all here, I went
to invite the gang from school.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.420
It's been a long time, Mother.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.930
What do you think of my dancing?

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.700
That's how you scoop
a loach from the water.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.980
What did you say?!?

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.950
Say, Ukiya?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.890
Uh, listen...
l, that is, um...

00:20:58.960 --> 00:20:59.890
What is it?

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:03.390
What I'm trying to
say is... l, uh...

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.230
It's about what happened a long
time ago, and just recently...

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.890
...you know?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.600
Huh?

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.270
I'll say it all at
once, okay? Thank...

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.170
Ukiya, Ukiya, Ukiyal!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.510
When are we going to the pool?

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.310
Oh, crap! I forgot I promised.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:26.320
That's no good.
Fei's really looking forward to it.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.980
This way, this way!
This way, Ukiya!

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.950
Yeesh...

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:46.370
Yukino... thank you.

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:11.050
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:14.910
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:19.890
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:23.260
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:25.390
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:33.900
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.900 --> 00:22:38.530
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:43.410
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:48.040
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:54.820
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
